@echo off
chcp 65001 >nul
:: ============================================================
:: Local AI keys template (FQXS)
::
:: Usage: copy this file to ai-keys.bat (same folder, gitignored),
::        replace the placeholders with real keys, then run start.bat.
::        start.bat calls ai-keys.bat before launch.
::
:: Each key is independent; configure any one to enable that engine.
:: With none configured the rank features still work.
::
:: IMPORTANT: keep this file ASCII-only. cmd parses .bat files with the
:: system code page (GBK); UTF-8 Chinese text can swallow the following
:: lines and silently disable the `if not defined` assignments.
:: ============================================================

:: Zhipu GLM-4-Flash (free): https://open.bigmodel.cn/
:: Console -> API Keys -> copy a key like xxxxxxxx.yyyyyyyy
if not defined GLM_API_KEY set "GLM_API_KEY=<your-glm-key>"

:: Baidu Qianfan ERNIE-Speed (enable the online service first):
:: https://console.bce.baidu.com/qianfan/ais/console/apiKey -> key like bce-v3/ALTAK-...
if not defined QIANFAN_API_KEY set "QIANFAN_API_KEY=<your-qianfan-key>"

:: SiliconFlow Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct (free tier): https://cloud.siliconflow.cn/
:: API Keys -> create -> key like sk-xxxxxxxx
if not defined QWEN_API_KEY set "QWEN_API_KEY=<your-qwen-key>"
